   },
   "title": "About Krea 2",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## About Krea 2\n\nKrea's 12.9B open-weights text-to-image model (June 2026). **Turbo** is the distilled version: high quality in **8 steps at CFG 1**. This template runs the FP8 Turbo checkpoint (12.2 GB) with the Qwen3-VL 4B text encoder and the Qwen-Image VAE, from Comfy-Org's ComfyUI package.\n\nLicence: **Krea 2 Community License** - read it before commercial use: https://huggingface.co/krea/Krea-2-Turbo/blob/main/LICENSE.pdf"
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    1320,
    736
   ],
   "size": [
    520,
    300
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 2,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "title": "About stage 2",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 2. Models - loaded once\n\n`krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors` (diffusion_models), `qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors` (text_encoders), `qwen_image_vae.safetensors` (vae). Downloaded by setup; they stay loaded between runs.\n\nOther precisions (set at deploy, keep `raw` for training): `KREA2_MODELS=bf16,raw` (48 GB+ GPUs), `nvfp4,raw` (RTX 50xx / Blackwell, 7 GB). Then pick the file in **Load Krea 2 Turbo**."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
